<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>Assam Nagaland Border Monitoring System | ASSAC</title>

  <!-- Google Fonts & Font Awesome Icons -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <!-- Custom External Styles -->
  <link href="/css/home.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body class="spatial-grid-bg">

  <!-- Header Navigation -->
  <header id="main-header" class="header">
    <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg">
      <div class="container">
        <a class="brand-container" href="#">
          <img src="/image/assac-logo.png" alt="ASSAC Logo" class="assac-logo">
          <div class="brand-titles">
            <span class="brand-org">Assam State Space Application Centre</span>
            <span class="brand-project">Assam - Nagaland Border Monitoring Portal</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <button class="navbar-toggler border-0 text-light ms-auto" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
          data-bs-target="#navbarNav" aria-controls="navbarNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
          <i class="fas fa-bars"></i>
        </button>

        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
          <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto align-items-lg-center">
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link active" href="#">Home</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link" href="#inventory">Onboarded Data</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link" href="#datasets">Project Scope</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item">
              <a class="nav-link" href="#capabilities">Processing Pipeline</a>
            </li>
            <li class="nav-item ms-lg-3 mt-2 mt-lg-0">
              <a href="/admin/home" class="btn-admin">
                <i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Official Login
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <!-- Modern Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero-modern">
    <div class="hero-bg-overlay"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <div class="row align-items-stretch g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-7 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
          <div>
            <div class="status-badge">
              <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
              Quarterly Change Detection Of Assam-Nagaland Border
            </div>

            <h1 class="hero-title">
              Development of Comprehensive Change & <span>Encroachment Detection System</span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-subtitle">
              A specialized decision support system utilizing multi-temporal satellite data (1989 base year onward) and
              high-resolution UAV surveys to map Land Use / Land Cover (LULC) dynamics and boundary encroachment across
              the 512 km Assam- Nagaland interstate border.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-actions pt-2">
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-portal-primary" target="_blank">
              <i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i> Launch WebGIS Application
            </a>
            <button type="button" class="btn-portal-secondary" data-bs-toggle="modal"
              data-bs-target="#aboutProjectModal">
              <i class="fas fa-file-lines"></i> Technical Scope of Work
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-5">
          <!-- Glassmorphic Border Telemetry Card -->
          <div class="hero-telemetry-card">
            <div>
              <div class="card-terminal-bar">
                <span><i class="fas fa-satellite text-teal me-1"></i> DISPUTED AREA BELT (DAB)</span>
                <span class="text-success"><i
                    class="fas fa-circle me-1 font-monospace status-dot-icon"></i>ACTIVE</span>
              </div>

              <!-- Fixed Exact Spec Grid -->
              <div class="satellite-spec-grid">
                <div class="telemetry-tile">
                  <div class="tile-title">Inter-state Border</div>
                  <div class="tile-data">512 km</div>
                </div>
                <div class="telemetry-tile">
                  <div class="tile-title">Disputed Land Area</div>
                  <div class="tile-data">1033.02 Sq.Km.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="telemetry-tile">
                  <div class="tile-title">Area Of Interest</div>
                  <div class="tile-data">386.67 Sq.km.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="telemetry-tile">
                  <div class="tile-title">Dispute Hotspots</div>
                  <div class="tile-data">9</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Auto-Changing Satellite Slide Viewport -->
            <div class="hero-slide-viewport" id="heroSlideViewport">
              <div class="hero-slide-item hero-slide-1 active"></div>
              <div class="hero-slide-item hero-slide-2"></div>
              <div class="hero-slide-item hero-slide-3"></div>

              <div class="hero-slide-overlay"></div>
              <div class="hero-slide-info">
                <span><i class="fas fa-crosshairs text-teal me-1"></i> Multi-Temporal Raster Stream</span>
                <span id="slideIndicator">1 / 3</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Onboarded Geospatial Data Inventory -->
  <section class="onboarded-data-section py-5 position-relative border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-10"
    id="inventory">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-end mb-4">
        <div>
          <div
            class="d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-pill mb-2 border border-info border-opacity-25 active-catalog-badge">
            <i class="fas fa-server"></i> Active Catalog Ingestion
          </div>
          <h2 class="section-headline mb-1">Onboarded Data Repository</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- 1. Raster Datasets -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="onboarded-card">
            <div class="card-status-strip bg-cyan"></div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-3">
              <div class="onboarded-icon-box text-cyan">
                <i class="fas fa-satellite-dish"></i>
              </div>
              <span class="inventory-status-pill text-emerald border-emerald-subtle">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Published
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="onboarded-number text-white" data-counter="<%= userItems.rastercount %>">
              <%= userItems.rastercount %>
            </div>
            <h5 class="onboarded-title">Raster Datasets</h5>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. LULC Layers -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="onboarded-card">
            <div class="card-status-strip bg-emerald"></div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-3">
              <div class="onboarded-icon-box text-emerald">
                <i class="fas fa-layer-group"></i>
              </div>
              <span class="inventory-status-pill text-emerald border-emerald-subtle">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Published
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="onboarded-number text-white" data-counter="<%= userItems.lulccount %>">
              <%= userItems.lulccount %>
            </div>
            <h5 class="onboarded-title">LULC Layers</h5>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. LULC Change Layers -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="onboarded-card">
            <div class="card-status-strip bg-amber"></div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-3">
              <div class="onboarded-icon-box text-amber">
                <i class="fas fa-code-compare"></i>
              </div>
              <span class="inventory-status-pill text-emerald border-emerald-subtle">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Published
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="onboarded-number text-white" data-counter="<%= userItems.lulcchange %>">
              <%= userItems.lulcchange %>
            </div>
            <h5 class="onboarded-title">LULC Change Layers</h5>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Hotspot Layers -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="onboarded-card">
            <div class="card-status-strip bg-rose"></div>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-start mb-3">
              <div class="onboarded-icon-box text-rose">
                <i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i>
              </div>
              <span class="inventory-status-pill text-emerald border-emerald-subtle">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle me-1"></i> Published
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="onboarded-number text-white" data-counter="<%= userItems.hotspotcount %>">
              <%= userItems.hotspotcount %>
            </div>
            <h5 class="onboarded-title">Hotspot Layers</h5>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Project Scope & Coverage Metrics -->
  <section class="metrics-section" id="datasets">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-end mb-4">
        <div class="col-md-8">
          <h2 class="section-headline">Geospatial Border Observation Scope</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 text-md-end mb-4 mb-md-0">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- Interstate Boundary Length -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-top">
              <div class="metric-icon-wrap icon-boundary">
                <i class="fas fa-road"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-number" data-counter="512">512</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Total Border Length (km)</div>
            <p class="metric-desc">Boundary between Assam & Nagaland demarcated with 1033.02 Sq.km. disputed
              belt.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Bilateral Buffer Corridor -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-top">
              <div class="metric-icon-wrap icon-buffer">
                <i class="fas fa-arrows-split-up-and-left"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-number" data-counter="386.67">386.67</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Disputed Area Of Interest (Sq.km.)</div>
            <p class="metric-desc">Total disputed land under Area of Interest between Assam & Nagaland </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-top">
              <div class="metric-icon-wrap icon-mmu">
                <i class="fas fa-vector-square"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-number" data-counter="25">25</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Minimum Mapping Unit (sq.m)</div>
            <p class="metric-desc">Fine-grained MMU threshold ensuring detection of isolated settlements, clearings, and
              rural roads.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Designated Dispute Sectors -->
        <div class="col-xl-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="metric-card">
            <div class="metric-top">
              <div class="metric-icon-wrap icon-sectors">
                <i class="fas fa-map-location-dot"></i>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="metric-number" data-counter="9">9</div>
            <div class="metric-label">Interstate Dispute Hotspots</div>
            <p class="metric-desc">Chungajan &bull; Near Dhanshri &bull; Vihokhu Village &bull; Shitoi Region &bull;
              Near Ekorani &bull; Near
              Chungtiayimsen &bull; Geleki &bull; Singlo F.V. &bull; Near Singlo F.V.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Smooth Interactive LULC Comparison & Transformation Section -->
  <section class="demo-section" id="comparison">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center mb-4">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="section-headline">Interactive Satellite vs. LULC Change Detection Swipe</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-5 text-lg-end mt-3 mt-lg-0">
          <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary text-light px-3" id="resetSwipeBtn">
            <i class="fas fa-arrows-left-right me-1"></i> Center Divider (50%)
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <!-- Smooth Swipe Viewport -->
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <div class="swipe-container" id="swipeViewport">
            <!-- Under layer: Natural Color Multi-Spectral Imagery -->
            <div class="swipe-layer layer-satellite-img"></div>

            <!-- Over layer: False-Color Classified Thematic LULC -->
            <div class="swipe-layer layer-lulc-img" id="clippedLayer"></div>

            <!-- Ultra-smooth draggable divider bar -->
            <div class="swipe-indicator-bar" id="dragDivider">
              <div class="swipe-handle">
                <i class="fas fa-arrows-left-right"></i>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Labels -->
            <div class="layer-pill pill-left">
              <i class="fas fa-mountain me-1 text-info"></i> Satellite Imagery
            </div>
            <div class="layer-pill pill-right">
              <i class="fas fa-layer-group me-1 text-warning"></i> Classified LULC
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Real-time LULC Dynamics Inspector -->
        <div class="col-lg-4">
          <div class="transition-matrix h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
            <div>
              <h5 class="text-white fw-bold mb-3 matrix-heading">
                <i class="fas fa-chart-pie me-2 text-teal"></i> LULC Transformation Dynamics
              </h5>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-3">Key land conversion classes tracked across the 2 km buffer and 1972
                Interim Reserve Forests:</p>

              <div class="matrix-row">
                <span class="class-badge text-light">
                  <span class="color-swatch swatch-rose"></span> Forest &rsaquo; Settlement / Built-Up
                </span>
                <span class="font-monospace small text-danger fw-bold">Critical Alert</span>
              </div>

              <div class="matrix-row">
                <span class="class-badge text-light">
                  <span class="color-swatch swatch-emerald"></span> Forest &rsaquo; Agricultural Clearing
                </span>
                <span class="font-monospace small text-muted">Active Shift</span>
              </div>

              <div class="matrix-row">
                <span class="class-badge text-light">
                  <span class="color-swatch swatch-amber"></span> Dense Forest &rsaquo; Open Forest
                </span>
                <span class="font-monospace small text-muted">Canopy Thinning</span>
              </div>

              <div class="matrix-row">
                <span class="class-badge text-light">
                  <span class="color-swatch swatch-cyan"></span> Other Land-Use Dynamics
                </span>
                <span class="font-monospace small text-muted">Quarterly Track</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25">
              <div class="small text-muted mb-1">Protected Reserve Forests (1972 Agreements):</div>
              <div class="small text-light font-monospace">Chungajan &bull; Near Dhanshri &bull; Vihokhu Village &bull;
                Shitoi Region &bull; Near Ekorani &bull; Near
                Chungtiayimsen &bull; Geleki &bull; Singlo F.V. &bull; Near Singlo F.V.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Pipeline / Features -->
  <section class="features-section" id="capabilities">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row mb-4">
        <div class="col-lg-7">
          <h2 class="section-headline">Geospatial Processing Architecture</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">
              <i class="fas fa-satellite"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="feature-title">Multi-Sensor Data Tier</h4>
            <p class="feature-text">Historical 1989 base data (Landsat) ,
              2008 AVNIR data, post-2017 Sentinel-2 (~10m), PlanetScope (~3m) 2024 onwards
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">
              <i class="fas fa-gears"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="feature-title">ERDAS Image Preprocessing & Semantic Segmentation</h4>
            <p class="feature-text">Comprehensive image rectification, contrast/brightness adjustments, georeferencing,
              Open source Neural Network based Semantic Segmentation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">
              <i class="fas fa-drone"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="feature-title">High-Precision UAV Surveys</h4>
            <p class="feature-text">Deployment of Unmanned Aerial Vehicles (UAVs) over critical dispute hotspots for
              sub-decimeter ground validation, addressing terrain and logistical parameters.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6">
          <div class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon-box">
              <i class="fas fa-laptop-code"></i>
            </div>
            <h4 class="feature-title">WebGIS & Field Validation</h4>
            <p class="feature-text">Enterprise PostGIS/ArcGIS geodatabase feeding an interactive Web-GIS dashboard with
              NDVI tools, change detection layers, ground truthing points, and field photos.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Project Details Modal -->
  <div class="modal fade" id="aboutProjectModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="aboutProjectModalLabel"
    aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable">
      <div class="modal-content about-modal">
        <div class="modal-header">
          <h5 class="modal-title" id="aboutProjectModalLabel">
            <i class="fas fa-circle-info text-teal me-2"></i>
            Development of Comprehensive Change & Encroachment Detection System
          </h5>
          <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
        </div>

        <div class="modal-body">
          <div class="modal-nav-tabs">
            <button class="modal-tab-btn active" data-tab="tab-overview">Project Background</button>
            <button class="modal-tab-btn" data-tab="tab-methodology">Database & Methodology</button>
          </div>

          <!-- Tab 1: Project Background -->
          <div class="tab-content-panel active" id="tab-overview">
            <p class="text-light mb-3">
              The project <strong>Development of Comprehensive Change and Encroachment Detection System using
                Geospatial Technology</strong> monitors the interstate border between Assam and Nagaland, which spans
              512 km (434 km demarcated; 66,000 Ha disputed belt).
            </p>
            <div class="spec-item">
              <h6>Dispute Hotspots</h6>
              <p>The border is demarcated into nine hotspots: covering Sivasagar, Golaghat, Jorhat,
                and Karbi Anglong districts in Assam. Territorial claims lie prominently across the Disputed
                Area Belt (DAB).</p>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-item">
              <h6>1972 Interim Agreement Reserve Forests</h6>
              <p>Four interim agreements signed in 1972 declared the reserve forests of Geleki, Abhoypur, Tiru Hills,
                Dessoi Valley, and Doyang off-limits for unapproved development and road construction.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Tab 2: Database & Methodology -->
          <div class="tab-content-panel" id="tab-methodology">
            <div class="spec-item">
              <h6>Base Year (1989) & Temporal Sensors</h6>
              <p>Base year (January 1989) satellite imagery sourced from USGS/EarthExplorer Landsat (~30m resolution).
                Intermediate mappings utilize AVNIR 2008 data, with
                post-2017 monitoring leveraging Sentinel-2 (~10m), and PlanetScope 3m resolution satellite imagery.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="spec-item">
              <h6>Minimum Mapping Unit (MMU) & Transitions</h6>
              <p>Standardized MMU of 25 sq.m. The analysis tracks conversions including Forest to
                Settlement/Built-up, Agriculture, Open Forest, and other rapid land-use shifts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="modal-footer">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm px-4" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
